Rule 1 (input and other tensors must be integral dtypes; suppresses "lshift_cpu not implemented for 'Half'")
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5) ∧ (1 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5)
